					"nextDialogs": [
						400040302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040302,
					"content": "你就是凯亚先生推荐来的线人吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040303,
					"content": "什么线人？不是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040304,
					"content": "可是，在这个约好的地方，只有你啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040305,
					"content": "什么约好的？不知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040307,
					"content": "「酒中出真知。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400040310,
					"content": "都、都在酒里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400040306,
					"content": "哇，真是让人烦躁的态度！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040307,
						400040310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040308,
					"content": "嗯，是自己人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040309,
					"content": "这个形式上的流程有什么意义！？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040311,
					"content": "嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040312,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040313,
					"content": "嗯，虽然暗号错了，但如果都在酒里，那真知也应该在酒里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040314,
					"content": "没错。是自己人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040315,
					"content": "这个形式上的流程有什么意义！？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040316,
					"content": "有什么想问的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040317,
					"content": "事情是这样的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040318,
					"content": "这样吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040319,
					"content": "有什么内部的消息吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040320,
					"content": "我觉得这应该不是盗宝团所为。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040321,
					"content": "盗宝团能够打下横跨多国的基业，是因为他们永远遵循一个最根本的原则。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040322,
					"content": "——「富贵险中求」都是骗人的鬼话，稳扎稳打才是人间正道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040323,
					"content": "璃月港可是有仙人守护的，尤其是在海灯节期间…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040324,
					"content": "",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040325,
					"content": "所以对海灯节出手，这事我们——对不起，角色没缓过来——这事盗宝团绝不会做。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040326,
					"content": "而且…璃月那里的盗宝团组织，最近收到了一封匿名信。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宁禄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040327,
					"content": "匿名信？难道是有人准备栽赃盗宝团？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040328,
					"content": "这就不得而知了。但我可以告诉你们这封信在盗宝团的哪个分部手里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
